WEBVTT

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:13.390
Romeo's Blue Skies

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:12.830
"To the Sky..."

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:17.850
<i>Overlooking the rows of houses and stores</i>

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:22.260
<i>from the highest vantage,</i>

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:27.370
<i>Such things as tears and sadness</i>

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:31.510
<i>will quickly vanish</i>

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:37.070
<i>The birds, wind, and sunshine...</i>

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:41.260
<i>...all are your friends</i>

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>I'll carry this dream farther than far</i>

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:51.420
<i>...no matter the distance...</i>

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>I long to fly freely</i>

00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:02.460
<i>through the blue sky in my heart...</i>

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:05.390
<i>The far distant blue sky</i>

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:12.840
<i>It flows into tomorrow</i>

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:25.230
Takara Fansubs

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:33.100
<i>Alfredo, sensing he would not recover,</i>

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:38.520
<i>...devised a plan to break into the banquet and reveal the truth to the King.</i>

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:42.600
<i>Romeo busied himself with preparations,</i>

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:45.860
<i>...as enthusiastic about the plan as the rest of the Black Brothers.</i>

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:49.800
<i>But the night before the banquet,</i>

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:55.400
<i>...Alfredo was suddenly confronted with Giovanni, the leader of the Wolf Pack.</i>

00:01:55.510 --> 00:02:00.430
Episode 27:

00:01:55.510 --> 00:02:00.430
The Start of a Long Day

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:12.200
Alfredo, let's settle our differences once and for all!

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:14.450
I'm going to defeat you!

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:17.530
Giovanni, why are you so bent on defeating me?

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:22.560
I've been looking for somebody like you for a long time.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:25.290
You're the only guy I can take seriously as an opponent.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:30.290
I appreciate that. But aren't you overestimating me?

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:34.260
You'll see if I'm overestimating you.

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:46.710
Not bad... I'm starting to like you, Alfredo.

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:48.540
Same here, Giovanni.

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:50.070
Go for it!

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.660
Time to finish you off!

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:06.990
Alfredo... Dammit, you're sick!

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:09.990
Mind your own business.

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:13.690
I'm not so low that I'd hit a guy...

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:15.850
...who can't stand upright on his own feet.

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:21.320
Let's call it a night. We can settle this at a later time.

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:24.410
In the meantime, keep this as proof.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:26.700
All right.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:31.150
Then I'll be going. So long.

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.110
Wait, Alfredo.

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:35.740
Alfredo, are you...

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:40.190
We're more alike than I thought.

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:45.100
If I had more time, we might have become friends...

00:03:45.650 --> 00:03:49.750
If you had more time?
What does that mean?

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:53.080
So long, Giovanni.
- Alfredo!

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:55.840
Answer me! What does that mean?

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:04.850
<i>Damn it.</i>

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:07.610
<i>He didn't beat me.</i>

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:10.540
<i>Why do I feel like I've been beaten?</i>

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:13.380
Giovanni.
- How'd it go with Alfredo?

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:16.050
Giovanni must have wiped up the floor with him!

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:17.260
One punch?

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:19.860
That's our Giovanni, he's one in a million.

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:25.220
Ow!
- Quit your yammering!

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:29.140
So it's not settled yet. SO WHAT?!

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:32.070
You blank-faced idiots!

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:34.520
Go and do something useful for once in your lives!

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:40.270
I've never seen Giovanni so angry.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.350
What do you think happened?

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:45.080
I'll bet he didn't find Alfredo.

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:47.250
Could be...

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:51.030
How could we get him back to his old self again?

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:52.510
I know!

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:58.000
Why don't we capture Alfredo and offer him to Giovanni?

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:01.300
Capture Alfredo?
- Good idea!

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:02.950
Good idea!

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:38.640
Then take it from him, Mauricio... every last penny.

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:40.230
It's easy.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:42.830
Take his money? How?

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:47.880
We send him to Heaven.

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:52.170
Alfredo! Run! We've been betrayed.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:55.410
Take this with you, it's the treasure of the Martini family.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:03.040
<i>Mother, Father, please give me courage.</i>

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:11.200
<i>And so, the sun arose on a fateful day for Alfredo.</i>

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:17.060
<i>...and for Romeo as well.</i>

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:21.110
<i>Finally... Finally... It's today!</i>

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:40.890
I've been waiting so long for this day!

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:44.540
You're more beautiful than ever, Grazela.

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:48.050
Our aristocratic standing will soon be handed to us on a plate.

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:01.030
Once the parade is over, then the banquet starts.

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:06.670
They say only the elite of the elite have been invited?

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:10.800
That's right. It's an honor just to have been invited.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:14.610
Fancy that! Just takes one's breath away.

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:18.000
We can see better over here.

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:23.120
The King and Queen are passing by!

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:25.280
It's beautiful!

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:26.580
I can't see.

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.990
Mom, I can't see anything.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:35.150
My poor Anzelmo, don't worry....
Dad'll do something.

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:36.300
Hey! Dear!

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:39.690
Where'd he go?

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:40.640
Dad!

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:48.240
Since everyone's having fun today, I'll have some fun at the bar.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:53.980
Is Alfredo here?
- Not yet.

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:55.690
It's finally going to happen.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:57.690
I'm itching to go.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.840
Are they ready?
- We can do it at a moment's notice.

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:06.690
Does an Alfredo live here?

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:09.270
That's me.
- Here.

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:11.270
For me?
- Yeah.

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:14.980
Who's this from?

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:19.210
"Bianca's in trouble."

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:23.530
"Come quickly under the Santa Maria bridge."

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:25.050
"Nikita."

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:26.690
Bianca!

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:31.710
What a nitwit.

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:37.180
Nikita was right. He'll do anything for his sister.

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:41.030
But won't Nikita get mad that you're using her name?

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:42.160
She won't care!

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:42.910
Let's go.

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:51.880
Almost time for the banquet.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:56.840
This is the place.

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:00.810
Why's he going under there?

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:09.400
Romeo!

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:17.430
Sorry for arriving late, but I just finished the dress.

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:20.530
Now we just wait for Alfredo.

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:22.450
My brother isn't here yet?

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:23.690
He'll be here soon.

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:26.950
In the meantime, we'll go over the plan once more.

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:38.500
Bianca! Nikita!

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:41.120
Where are you?

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:46.100
There he is. Remember, capture him.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:06.980
Bianca, are you in there?

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:15.920
Just a rat...

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:18.300
You're Tachioni!

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:20.800
Cool your heels in there for a while, Alfredo!

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:25.710
Open up! Open up!

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:29.390
He fell for it hook, line and sinker.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:31.750
Leo, go call Giovanni.

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:32.610
Okay.

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:37.860
Tachioni! Where are Bianca and Nikita?

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:39.600
Search me.

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:44.070
I just heard that you'd come running at the sound of Bianca's name.

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:54.410
What happened to Alfredo?

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.300
Don't ask me.

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:03.180
The door's locked.

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.530
Romeo, what the heck happened to Alfredo?

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:27.230
What do we do now?

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:30.650
Everyone stay here.
I'll go look for Alfredo.

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:33.800
I'm coming with you.
- Me too.

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:37.790
<i>Big brother.</i>

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.380
Let's split up and look.

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:56.540
We have to find him no matter what.

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:57.840
OK.

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:02.470
Everybody's having fun... Everybody's...

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:07.810
Heya Romeo...
- Boss, have you seen Alfredo?

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:09.500
Sure...

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:12.920
Where? Where did you see him?

00:12:13.010 --> 00:12:14.680
Over there...

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:17.420
Over here...

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:21.100
Boss, tell me!
Where did you see him?

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:25.400
Alfredo's... down in the ground...

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:28.260
In the ground?
What does that mean?

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.590
Don't you know anything?

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:35.430
What else? Santa Maria bridge, of course...

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:38.050
Santa Maria bridge...

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:40.250
You did WHAT to Alfredo?

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:43.800
You bastard! You used my name to lure him out there?

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:46.250
I'll never forgive you!

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:49.200
Hey, but I just...
- Out of the way, Nikita.

00:12:49.210 --> 00:12:51.670
Giovanni...
- Move!

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:54.980
When did I tell you to trick him?

00:12:55.750 --> 00:13:00.660
If you pull something underhanded, it means he wins!

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:04.280
Damn!
- Giovanni, I'm coming too.

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:06.150
W... wait!

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:08.950
Underneath Santa Maria bridge?

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:11.290
Here it is.

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:26.520
Snap out of it... If I don't get out of here in a hurry...

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:30.270
I might not be in time for the banquet.

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:43.310
Good. It's open.

00:13:56.300 --> 00:13:58.100
If I don't get out of here...

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:04.610
Romeo.

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:08.460
Alfredo! Where are you?

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:09.790
It's Romeo!

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:12.720
Alfredo!

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:16.860
Tachioni! So it was you guys.

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:18.960
We've trapped Alfredo.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.910
What?!
- You'll need this to get him out.

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:24.420
But... I'm not giving it to you.

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:32.670
Come on, Romeo!
Let's settle our differences here!

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:34.670
Hey!

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:37.730
Dante, did you find my brother?

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:40.360
He's not at the secret base.

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:43.160
I even stopped by the palace for a quick look,

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:45.780
...and the royalty is beginning to arrive.

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:47.540
It doesn't look good.

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:49.530
I'm going to look for him!
- Stop!

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:51.110
Don't stop me.

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:53.030
Your going wouldn't change anything.

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:58.960
Give Romeo a chance. He'll come back with Alfredo, I know it.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.110
Come on, Romeo!

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:05.330
I don't have time to waste playing around with you.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:06.370
After him!

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:08.200
Wait!

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:20.340
Where'd he go?

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:27.420
Let's split up.

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:28.520
Right.

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:40.910
Got to get to the... banquet...

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:43.070
It's a dead end.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:47.120
Something's wrong.
We should have found him.

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:49.080
I'm going back!

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:55.740
Alfredo's... in here?

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:09.450
Alfredo! Alfredo, it's me!

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:11.810
Are you all right, Alfredo?

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:13.200
Romeo!

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:15.030
I'm coming, Alfredo.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:18.950
Let's go! Romeo's over there! Follow me!

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:35.200
Romeo! Are you hurt?

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:40.440
I'm okay... Thanks to this padding here.

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:42.010
That was insane...

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:45.750
Nonetheless... here I am.

00:16:46.220 --> 00:16:46.990
Romeo.

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:49.850
He jumped through this window.

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:51.150
He's crazy.

00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:54.350
We don't have much time left.

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:55.720
Come on.

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:01.050
Here. If we move this box, the door will open.

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:02.370
All right...

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:08.650
Break it down, Faustino!

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:16.700
It looks like it leads up to the surface.

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:21.810
Alfredo... you go.
I'll stay behind and stall them.

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:23.290
Romeo.
- Go. Hurry!

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:25.300
No! Come with me!

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:27.410
You've got to go meet the King.

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:32.060
Tell him who it was that killed your mother and father.

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:36.470
Get into the banquet, for the sake of your own honor... and Bianca's.

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:40.060
I'll protect you.

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:43.550
Romeo... Thank you.

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:47.400
Alfredo.

00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:03.740
Romeo! Where's Alfredo?

00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:05.850
I wouldn't tell you even if I did know.

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:07.020
Move aside!

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:10.350
You're not getting past me.
- Why, you...

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:16.870
Go ahead, hit me as much as you want.

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:18.950
But you're not getting past me.

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:21.130
Romeo.

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:22.600
Giovanni!

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:26.170
Tell me. Why do you stand up for him this way?

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:30.670
You wouldn't understand.

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:33.890
Sure, you may be strong.

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:37.370
But you just make your friends obey you through force.

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:39.050
It's different with Alfredo.

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:43.900
Everybody becomes courageous in his presence.

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:46.480
Alfredo is the only one with real strength.

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:47.690
He's right!

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:49.210
Nikita.

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:52.140
Alfredo made me swear to silence.

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:54.720
But I can't take it anymore!

00:18:56.610 --> 00:18:59.460
Alfredo's not going to get better.

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:03.160
He's got the same illness that killed your father!

00:19:08.320 --> 00:19:09.380
You're lying...

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.340
You're lying!

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:13.650
You're gonna get it if you're not telling the truth, Nikita!

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:15.640
I wish I WAS lying!

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:22.140
He never let it show on his face... That's just how he is.

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:30.010
Alfredo... why didn't you tell me?

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:36.580
He...

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:43.850
Big brother!

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.940
Sorry if I made you worry.

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:49.160
Alfredo!
- What happened?

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:50.220
I apologize.

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:53.330
Now then... to the King!

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:54.670
To the King!

00:19:58.640 --> 00:20:01.990
Giovanni, let's finish this fight tomorrow.

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:02.560
What?

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:08.490
I have to be at the royal palace tonight no matter what.

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:09.730
The royal palace?

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:13.190
I've got to bring Alfredo to see the King.

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:16.690
Hah! Are you guys out of your minds?

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:18.610
You, keep out of it!

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:19.950
Go on.

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:23.390
Alfredo is my best friend.

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:25.860
I wouldn't lose his friendship for anything in the world...

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:30.840
My best friend is putting his life on the line to protect his honor.

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:35.820
So I have to be there to protect him.

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:42.000
Once it's over, I'll come back here to finish this fight. I promise.

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:46.230
You'll come back here tomorrow, then? Alone...?

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:47.730
I will. I promise.

00:20:49.230 --> 00:20:52.990
Romeo, you and Alfredo are real friends.

00:20:53.740 --> 00:20:57.250
Listen up, everybody! We're going to break into the banquet too!

00:20:58.130 --> 00:21:00.490
We're going to lend Alfredo and Romeo a hand.

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:02.010
Giovanni!

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:05.820
I'll be looking forward to our next fight afterwards.

00:21:06.020 --> 00:21:07.260
Great idea, Giovanni!

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:12.260
Romeo, let's join forces... the Wolf Pack and the Black Brothers.

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:14.660
Let's save Alfredo together.

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:17.610
Okay. Giovanni...

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.970
It's just for one night, Romeo.

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:23.240
Okay... For Alfredo's sake.

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:30.620
Where'd he go?

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:34.280
Who are you looking for, little boy?

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:38.290
Would you happen to know where we might find Alfredo?

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:46.050
<i>Romeo, I'll meet the King...
and tell him the truth.</i>

00:21:56.280 --> 00:22:01.680
<i>We make it to the castle grounds, past Mauricio's interference.</i>

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:04.060
<i>Our destination: The Great Hall, where we'll find the King!</i>

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:08.310
<i>Go and tell the King the truth!</i>

00:22:08.950 --> 00:22:12.370
See you then!

00:22:08.950 --> 00:22:12.370
<i>Lord Alfredo</i>

00:22:08.950 --> 00:22:12.370
Next time:

00:22:13.740 --> 00:22:17.740
<i>"Si Si Ciao ~ On These Roman Roofs"</i>

00:22:26.350 --> 00:22:30.450
<i>Si Si Ciao, why do the good times</i>

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:34.750
<i>seem to end so soon?</i>

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:38.950
<i>Si Si Ciao, we're all friends</i>

00:22:39.150 --> 00:22:43.150
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>

00:22:43.760 --> 00:22:48.060
<i>Your laughing voice dances</i>

00:22:48.060 --> 00:22:51.960
<i>Once again in the sky</i>

00:22:52.360 --> 00:22:59.260
<i>Your pocket bursting with memories</i>

00:23:00.960 --> 00:23:04.860
<i>Si Si Ciao, goodbye but for now</i>

00:23:05.060 --> 00:23:09.060
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>
